{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3943210/extras/49be75185bb862d06d45729f77d55783.avif?t=1768314087\" width=350 height=350 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a land plagued by monsters, undead, and the occasional truffle bandit, four unlikely heroes join forces to take on the impossible. With the help of a talkative bird, a roaring arena crowd, and a suspiciously lazy adventurer\u2019s guild, you\u2019ll fight, explore, and scheme your way to glory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Arena of Suffering is an old-school JRPG with modern polish. Explore bustling towns, ten dangerous dungeons, and a country full of trouble, all while battling over 120 unique monsters. Build your dream team from nine distinct classes and find devastating party combinations to absolutely flatten your opponents.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3943210/extras/6d68f9d4635d916530d04dd4401fddc9.avif?t=1768314087\" width=267 height=400 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Old-School Combat, Modern Shine \u2013 Front-view battles keep every fight tense, with detailed enemy art and strategic depth.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Party Creation Freedom \u2013 Nine unique classes to mix and match for any style: pure damage, brute force, magic dominance, or tricky crowd control.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bosses\u2026 and Their Bosses \u2013 Each dungeon has a story boss, two Elites with their own tactics, and a brutal Hidden Boss for those who crave punishment.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Epic Soundtrack \u2013 Over 50 original tracks, with unique themes for each boss and nine rotating battle tracks to keep combat fresh.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More Than Fighting \u2013 Explore towns, uncover hidden areas, tackle 40+ side quests, and meet a cast of colorful NPCs.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3943210/extras/ef2797be672ec5f59f99a57c93c3afd6.avif?t=1768314087\" width=250 height=250 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So enter the arena, prove your worth, and get rich in the process. The adventurer's guild is always looking for the right types of heroes, and you know you've got what is takes. Join today!</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"MINotaur","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3943210/1699af12ff6edac2ea4ebf9592207622e0fcc369.jpg"},{"name":"Whooo was that?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3943210/a2556ecc10d451d2811fd93ddc63d2ab5a072911.jpg"},{"name":"Which Lich to Pitch","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3943210/19fcfcf7224c03e8d54b5415ae50752f78262722.jpg"},{"name":"Flame Off!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3943210/803daefbf4592c0c808636493a236a37a34ddc11.jpg"},{"name":"The dragon was boned","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3943210/c834fe215fdfe06e1765196b89b0dc5c322af724.jpg"},{"name":"Why was it goopy?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3943210/69ed48cc24c6486c8a73dfea205a2e3a3920cccf.jpg"},{"name":"What fight was Dagon tough","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/ap