ast of colorful NPCs.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3943210/extras/ef2797be672ec5f59f99a57c93c3afd6.avif?t=1768314087\" width=250 height=250 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So enter the arena, prove your worth, and get rich in the process. The adventurer's guild is always looking for the right types of heroes, and you know you've got what is takes. Join today!</p>","developers":["Potato Publishing"],"genres":[{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3943210/28c0ffb060cb0a7b7de451de6015817279dc4e93/header.jpg?t=1768314087","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3943210/1649889625/1e1eea78844d84a31c74950c6210bacc2f221f74/1755791457/dash_av1.mpd?t=1755792497","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3943210/1649889625/1e1eea78844d84a31c74950c6210bacc2f221f74/1755791457/dash_h264.mpd?t=1755792497","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3943210/1649889625/1e1eea78844d84a31c74950c6210bacc2f221f74/1755791457/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1755792497","id":257184907,"name":"Arena of Suffering Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257184907/f708620c75a6e99a6f848942e6a88ffec3822cd2/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1755792497"}],"name":"Arena of Suffering","package_groups":[{"description":"","display_type":0,"is_recurring_subscription":"false","name":"default","save_text":"","selection_text":"Select a purchase option","subs":[{"can_get_free_license":"0","is_free_license":false,"option_description":"","option_text":"Arena of Suffering - $9.99 USD","packageid":1385082,"percent_savings":